cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the underlying paper below."
title: "MOHAWK (Python/MNE port)"
abstract: >-
  A Python/MNE reimplementation of the MOHAWK hdEEG brain-network pipeline,
  including the single-subject spectral/connectivity/graph analysis, the 3D
  connectivity topograph, and the group-level ROC screening and RBF-SVM
  classification from Chennu et al. (2017).
